  Colorwaves  on   4201/4201 equal, 4201 distinct, all lit, 4201 audio reads each side; before: equal
  Hiphotic    off  4201/4201 equal, 4201 distinct, all lit; before: equal
  Hiphotic    on   4201/4201 equal, 4201 distinct, all lit, 0 audio reads; before: equal
  Frizzles    off  4201/4201 equal, 4195 distinct, all lit; before: frame 1 pixel 70 B 225 vs 224
  Frizzles    on   4201/4201 equal, 4195 distinct, all lit, 0 audio reads; before: same
  Black Hole  off  4201/4201 equal, 4201 distinct, all lit; before: frame 2 pixel 90 R 195 vs 193
  Black Hole  on   4201/4201 equal, 4201 distinct, all lit, 0 audio reads; before: same
  Tartan      off  4201/4201 equal, 3687 distinct, all lit; before: frame 0 pixel 21 B 255 vs 254
  Tartan      on   4201/4201 equal, 3687 distinct, all lit, 0 audio reads; before: same
