Defects fixed on this branch
  ecce15f  Black Hole, Frizzles and Tartan add through the original color_add (0x42026220) with
           fast=0: overflow rescales as v*255/max, truncated. WLED 16's default preserveCR add
           lands one step lower (the "before" differences above). An oracle of 2048 original
           color_add calls (capture SHA256
           a8e36f83415aafb3494e54cc617aedfadf9007f09719dd3c0fc257a9ae0e8259) matches the helper
           2048/2048; WLED 16's formula matches 340. tests/test_glorb_color_add.py.
  c54b327  Black Hole passes mcol 0 to the palette wrapper as the original does
           (0x420431d9) and no longer reads check1. Visible only with palette 0. Palette-0 cases
           with colour gamma off on both sides (original gammaCorrectCol written 0), 64 frames
           with volume stepping every 8 frames (trace SHA256
           504da34ab0b5f51012f775545546db32b6bf07cedfc13cbbec73c47abf8b2d37): check1 clear,
           c54b327 64/64 equal, ecce15f differs at frame 0 pixel 69 B 1 vs 0; check1 set, both
           64/64 equal. tests/test_glorb_blackhole.py.

Short regression (64 frames, same short input, every case)
  Ten cases, palettes as above: 64/64 equal on c54b327, 64 distinct lit frames each, controls
  rejected. On 92e8321 Frizzles, Black Hole and Tartan fail at the frames listed above.

Not covered
  Palette 0 in the long runs and WLED 16 palette loading (both sides get the same expanded
  palette); the factory colour gamma 2.8 on palette 0 (the original gamma-corrects that colour,
  the port at gc 1.0 does not); frame cadence (both sides take the same scripted times;
  Hiphotic, Colorwaves and Running advance per call); effect switches and transitions (both start
  from black); 0.14 bus read-back below brightness 255; microphone PDM/AGC (processed volume is
  the input); the compiled S3 build (fleet_glorb only proves the source compiles); whole-firmware
  runs; physical output. No lamp was contacted or flashed. Vendor bytes and captures stay
  untracked.
